  "prefLabel": "Box 703.06 Emergency Medical Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 703.06 Emergency Medical Services. A promoter shall provide emergency medical technician (EMT) services and at least one ambulance present at all times during a competition. A promoter may have 2 ambulances in the event one has to make a run to the hospital. A commissioner or deputy inspector shall suspend a competition during the absence of the required EMT and ambulance services.\n\nSource. #10483, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14066 eff 8-27-24",
